This project aggregates independently licensed scientific artwork.
The software license for this repository does not relicense artwork.

Each redistributed artwork must retain its recorded creator, original source,
license, attribution, source version and modification information. Public-domain
and CC0 status are recorded per source/item; CC BY and CC BY-SA obligations remain
attached to the relevant material.

Upstream projects reused or consulted for data models and interface conventions:
- BioCartoon database/CLI: https://github.com/josephrich98/biocartoon (BSD-2-Clause).
  Source-adapter field mappings are adapted; the full copyright/license notice,
  exact inspected revision and source paths are in docs/upstream-biocartoon-license.txt.
- Iconify API: https://github.com/iconify/api (MIT).
- Bioicons website code: https://github.com/duerrsimon/bioicons (MIT; artwork varies).
- SciGlyph MCP: https://github.com/ZengZichao/SciGlyph-MCP (MIT; artwork CC BY 4.0).

The other projects are consulted references, not wholesale copies. Any vendored
or adapted source file must carry its actual upstream copyright/license notice
and a precise version/path record.

